bin/
obj/
site-*/
site-*
work/
golden/
*.user
.vs/
.DS_Store

# Ignore Markdown files by default, but keep the project docs tracked.
# plan.md/continue.md/todo.md are deliberately NOT allowlisted here: they are
# session-to-session working notes for AI-assisted development and are excluded from
# the public repo (kept locally, untracked) — see git history for the removal commit.
*.md
!README.md
!CONTRIBUTING.md
!SECURITY.md
!CLAUDE.md
!THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md
# User-facing documentation for the tool itself, as opposed to the repo's own notes.
!IDIOTS-GUIDE.md
!HOW-TO-USE.md
# Project-scoped agent skills are documentation of this repo's own conventions and
# belong to it, not to whoever happens to have it checked out.
!.claude/skills/**/*.md
